oi","20:39:20":"et afin que tu sois élevé","20:39:21":"sous","20:39:22":"Mon œil.","20:40:1":"Quand","20:40:2":"marchait","20:40:3":"ta sœur","20:40:4":"et disait :","20:40:5":"“Est-ce que (vous voulez)","20:40:6":"(que) je vous dirige","20:40:7":"vers","20:40:8":"quelqu’un qui","20:40:9":"sera responsable (de) lui ?”","20:40:10":"Nous t’avons donc fait retourner","20:40:11":"vers","20:40:12":"ta mère","20:40:13":"afin que","20:40:14":"refroidisse","20:40:15":"son œil (=qu’elle devienne heureuse)","20:40:16":"et ne","20:40:17":"soit (pas) triste.","20:40:18":"Et tu as tué","20:40:19":"une âme","20:40:20":"mais Nous t’avons sauvé","20:40:21":"de","20:40:22":"la tristesse","20:40:23":"et t’avons mis en grande épreuve","20:40:24":"(avec) une grande épreuve.","20:40:25":"Tu es donc resté","20:40:26":"(pendant) des années","20:40:27":"parmi","20:40:28":"(les) gens","20:40:29":"(de) Madian","20:40:30":"puis","20:40:31":"tu es arrivé","20:40:32":"à","20:40:33":"un (temps) déterminé,","20:40:34":"ô Moise !","20:41:1":"Et je t’ai formé de manière excellente","20:41:2":"pour Moi-même.","20:42:1":"Vas,","20:42:2":"toi","20:42:3":"et ton frère,","20:42:4":"avec Mes signes","20:42:5":"et ne","20:42:6":"devenez (pas) paresseux","20:42:7":"dans","20:42:8":"Mon rappel.","20:43:1":"Allez","20:43:2":"vers","20:43:3":"Pharaon !","20:43:4":"Certes, il","20:43:5":"a dépassé les limites !","20:44:1":"Et ensuite dites","20:44:2":"à lui","20:44:3":"une parole","20:44:4":"douce","20:44:5":"afin que peut-être il","20:44:6":"se rappellera","20:44:7":"ou","20:44:8":"craindra. »","20:45:1":"Ils ont dit :","20:45:2":"« Notre Maître !","20:45:3":"Certes, nous","20:45:4":"avons peur","20:45:5":"qu’","20:45:6":"il hâtera","20:45:7":"contre nous","20:45:8":"ou","20:45:9":"qu’","20:45:10":"il dépassera les limites ! »","20:46:1":"Il a dit :","20:46:2":"« Ne","20:46:3":"craignez (pas) !","20:46:4":"Certes, Je","20:46:5":"(suis) avec vous deux,","20:46:6":"J’entends","20:46:7":"et Je vois.","20:47:1":"