:"votre bétail.","20:54:4":"Certes,","20:54:5":"(il y a) en","20:54:6":"cela","20:54:7":"certainement des signes","20:54:8":"pour (ceux) doués","20:54:9":"(de) l’intelligence.","20:55:1":"D’elle","20:55:2":"Nous vous avons créés","20:55:3":"et en elle","20:55:4":"Nous vous ferons retourner","20:55:5":"et d’elle","20:55:6":"Nous vous ferons sortir","20:55:7":"une fois","20:55:8":"autre.","20:56:1":"Et très certainement","20:56:2":"Nous lui avons montré","20:56:3":"Nos signes,","20:56:4":"chacun (d’)eux,","20:56:5":"et il a ensuite démenti","20:56:6":"et a refusé.","20:57:1":"Il a dit :","20:57:2":"« Est-ce que tu es arrivé (chez) nous","20:57:3":"afin que tu nous fasses sortir","20:57:4":"de","20:57:5":"notre territoire","20:57:6":"avec ta magie,","20:57:7":"ô Moise ? »","20:58:1":"Nous t’amènerons alors très certainement","20:58:2":"[] de la magie","20:58:3":"semblable (à) elle.","20:58:4":"Fais donc","20:58:5":"entre nous","20:58:6":"et [entre] toi","20:58:7":"un temps promis","20:58:8":"(qui) ne pas","20:58:9":"nous le manquerons","20:58:10":"nous","20:58:11":"et pas (non plus)","20:58:12":"toi,","20:58:13":"(dans) un endroit","20:58:14":"Plat. »","20:59:1":"Il a dit :","20:59:2":"« Votre temps promis","20:59:3":"(est le) jour","20:59:4":"(de) l’ornement (=un festival égyptien)","20:59:5":"et que","20:59:6":"soient assemblés","20:59:7":"les gens","20:59:8":"(pendant) un matin. »","20:60:1":"Et s’est ensuite détourné","20:60:2":"Pharaon","20:60:3":"et a assemblé","20:60:4":"son complot","20:60:5":"puis","20:60:6":"est venu.","20:61:1":"A dit","20:61:2":"à eux","20:61:3":"Moïse :","20:61:4":"« Malheur (à) vous !","20:61:5":"N’","20:61:6":"inventez (pas)","20:61:7":"contre","20:61:8":"Allâh","20:61:9":"un mensonge,","20:61:10":"car Il vous anéantirai alors","20:61:11":"avec un châtiment.","20:61:12":"Et certainement","20:61:13":"est devenu dépourvu","20:61:14":"quiconque","20:61:15":"invente.","20:62:1":"Et ils se sont ensuite disputés","20:62:2":"(au sujet de) leur 